{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]This love en[Bb]dures, it knows no [F]bounds
[Dm]Would still em[Bb]brace the worst of [F]man
[Dm]What kind of [Bb]love would die for [F]one no good has done
{end_of_verse}
{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm]This love looks [Bb]past beyond all [F]sins
[Dm]Would trade His [Bb]glory for my [F]shame
